{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04149","headline":"侍宴韦嗣立山庄应制 · 徐彦伯","name":"侍宴韦嗣立山庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鼎臣休澣隙，方外结遥心。\n别业青霞境，孤潭碧树林。\n每驰东墅策，遥弄北溪琴。\n帝眷纾时豫，台园赏岁阴。\n移銮明月沼，张组白云岑。\n御酒瑶觞落，仙坛竹径深。\n三光悬圣藻，五等冠朝簪。\n自昔皇恩感，咸言独自今。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}